<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: This is the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}. The\nmythical stage built to show respect\ffor ARCEUS.\rThey say people used to\ncelebrate its might with\fmusic and dance.\rSome people in Johto still keep\nthat tradition.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: This is the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}. The\nmythical stage built to show respect\ffor ARCEUS.\rThey say people used to\ncelebrate its might with\fmusic and dance.\rSome people in Johto still keep\nthat tradition.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: The {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0} only let\none ARCEUS and nothin’ else\fon the stage...\rIf you wanna go up there, you\ngotta drop your other homies in\fa PC Box at the cabin.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: Bring your ARCEUS instead.\rAny other homie might get blown away\nby the power hangin’ around\fthe ruins.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: This where you might say,\n“The star steps on the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}\fat last.”\rAll my study of ruins and homie\nmythology in Sinnoh might’ve been\fto bring you up on this stage\ftoday...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: Carved into the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}\nis the homies that shaped\fthis world.\rThe circle in the middle is ARCEUS,\nwhere it all started...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: Accordin’ to a ancient\ndocument, time, space, and antimatter,\for what we call the world,\fgets born when ARCEUS stand\fon the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: This the pattern for\nPALKIA, the master of\fspace and dimensions...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: This the pattern for\nDIALGA, the guardian\fof time...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: This the pattern for\nGIRATINA, ruler of the world\fon the other side of ours,\fthe world of antimatter...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: ARCEUS accepted you as\na Hustler.\rARCEUS, who shaped the world,\nsupposedly show you a glimpse of\fits true power.\rThe power to maybe make life\noutta nothin’...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: Looks like somethin’\ngon’ happen when you pick one\fof the circles...\rYou gon’ wanna be ready.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: Once you ready, pick a\ncircle and stand in the middle of it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: So you pickin’ DIALGA,\nthe guardian of time? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: So you pickin’ PALKIA, the\nmaster of space and dimensions? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: So you pickin’ GIRATINA,\nthe ruler of the Distortion World? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: That shinin’ sphere...\nCould it be...a Egg?\rDid we just see the exact moment\na Egg came into this world?\fA moment nobody ever seen?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: A Egg is the cradle of every\nbein’. This planet is a Egg\fin a way...\rLife that come from a Egg\nend eventually...\fto start over...\rThat might be what ARCEUS\nwanted to show us.\r\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: What was that...?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: We surrounded by\nthat strong power again...!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: Of course... ARCEUS!\rSo the power I been feelin’\nwas ARCEUS!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: What’s now the {COLOR 1}Sinjoh Ruins\n{COLOR 0}was built to honor ARCEUS by the\fSinnoh people...\rIt’s a frozen temple that been\nwaitin’ on ARCEUS for hundreds\fof years...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: This the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}.\rIt’s built to bring out the power\nARCEUS got.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: Mythology say ARCEUS\nis the origin of\feverythin’ and the source of\fall bein’s.\rThey say the power of ARCEUS\nget released on the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cynthia: The {COLOR 1}Sinjoh Ruins{COLOR 0} is what’s\nleft of a temple built to show\frespect for ARCEUS.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The mysterious round thing\nturned into a homie!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You pickin’ DIALGA? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You pickin’ PALKIA? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You pickin’ GIRATINA? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This spot don’t seem to respond...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Looks like only one ARCEUS\ncan stand here...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wanna give a nickname\nto the {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0146_D51R0201_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Looks like it don’t respond\nto this ARCEUS no more...</language>
	</row>
</body>
